          "name": "Key Handle",
          "type": "FKeyHandle",
          "default": "FKeyHandle()"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "FKeyHandle",
      "docs": "Add a new key to the curve with the supplied Time and Value. Returns the handle of the new key.\n@param\tbUnwindRotation\t\tWhen true, the value will be treated like a rotation value in degrees, and will automatically be unwound to prevent flipping 360 degrees from the previous key\n@param  KeyHandle\t\t\tOptionally can specify what handle this new key should have, otherwise, it'll make a new one"
    },
